[length:04:12]
[ti:I don't want to be saved]
[ar:Aracnephobia]
[al:Chaotic-Dysfuntional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:11.31]I found you
[00:14.00]at the edge of the universe
[00:17.26]when the stars stopped promising
[00:20.44]and started laughing at us
[00:22.54]Far from the sun
[00:24.43]from the wounds
[00:27.63]from the ones
[00:31.23]who’d rather see me alive than dead
[00:34.93]In the void between
[00:36.68]what’s left of everything
[00:39.26]I breathe your name
[00:42.07]until it takes control
[00:49.48]Your dark eyes
[00:52.22]my open wound
[00:55.62]in a body
[00:56.53]that forgot how to heal
[01:02.40]Black holes
[01:05.31]I keep orbiting
[01:07.05]like I don’t already know 
[01:09.08]how this ends
[01:13.66]And I don’t want to be 
[01:16.89]saved
[01:19.73]There’s something worse than dying
[01:22.42]I felt it
[01:26.47]Living without
[01:28.15]something that can break you
[01:30.22]So don’t
[01:33.40]don’t save me now
[01:41.25]I’ve tasted blood
[01:44.40]on my lips
[01:46.33]been broken
[01:47.67]in every kiss
[01:50.93]And still
[01:54.88]the only place
[01:57.80]that feels like now
[02:00.85]is hiding in you
[02:07.08]Will you still love me
[02:09.60]when you see the hole in my chest?
[02:12.06]When there’s nothing left of me
[02:14.22]worth loving?
[02:16.10]You were always the only one
[02:18.80]The mistake
[02:19.59]every fairytale forgets to warn about
[02:24.05]I don’t want to be 
[02:27.21]saved
[02:29.92]We’re drowning
[02:31.47]we know it
[02:33.59]Holding hands
[02:35.63]all the way down
[02:38.87]There’s something sacred
[02:41.77]in the damage
[02:44.14]So don’t
[02:47.10]don’t save me now
[02:53.02]“Attachment detected”
[02:56.00]“Emotional instability rising”
[02:58.82]“Recommendation: disengage”
[03:01.29]There’s no salvation
[03:04.00]in this broken paradise
[03:07.65]Just the echo
[03:10.12]of something that won’t stop breathing…
[03:13.89]in me
[03:16.69]Silent drones
[03:19.27]whispering our names
[03:23.02]And we dance
[03:25.50]right at the edge
[03:32.47]If this is a sin
[03:37.80]let it be
[03:38.80]’Cause in your arms
[03:39.78]I don’t need redemption
[03:42.22]And this time
[03:43.34]not even forever
[03:52.13]I don’t want to be saved
